msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Multi Picture Object (MPO) image decoder"
msgstr "Díchódóir íomhá Il-Réad Pictiúr (MPO)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "An addon to decode MPO (multiple picture object) files. These are used mainly for 3D cameras and the Nintendo 3DS."
msgstr "Breiseán chun comhaid MPO (réad pictiúr il) a dhíchódú. Úsáidtear iad seo den chuid is mó le haghaidh ceamaraí 3D agus an Nintendo 3DS."

#. Supported file extension ".mpo" and mimetype "image/mpo" description
#: imagedecoder.raw/addon.xml.in
msgctxt "#30100"
msgid "An MPO file is a stereoscopic image that consists of two 2D .JPG images that are combined into one 3D image."
msgstr "Is íomhá steiréascópach í comhad MPO atá comhdhéanta de dhá íomhá 2T .JPG atá comhcheangailte in aon íomhá 3T amháin."
